SUMMARY:Halloween Party Fundraiser: Costume Parade/Magic Show/Bake Sale
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a spooktacular time in a 100+ year old church! Our halls will be eerily decorated! We are raising funds to support our food justice programs\, kitchen upkeep and outreach to ‘feed people: mind body and spirit’. We’re having a party for everyone from 1-100 years old and you’re invited! \nRSVP NOW AT KPUC.ORG \n•COSTUME PARADE: Show off your Halloween costume in our costume parade at the beginning set to some awesome music.\n• MAGICIANS SHOW: Magician Mark Lewis: As Seen on Canada’s Got Talent: Golden Buzzer Winner! Be delighted and tickled no matter how old you are with a magic show with wonderful talented elder.\n•SPOOKY PERFORMANCE: Halloween Organ and Harpsichord music: Enjoy the musical sounds of early music performer David Sandall: Halloween Organ and Harpsichord music fill the space with EERIE and beautiful sounds.\n• BAKE SALE: Pick up some delicious baked goods straight from our new commercial kitchen baked with love by community at KPUC.\n• Take a fun face hole photo\, make a friend\, bring a friend\, spread the word! \nCOST TO ATTEND:\nChildren and Youth under 12 Years old – FREE\nRATE: $20 General Admission\n$50 Flat rate for family 3 – 5
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/halloween-party-fundraiser-costume-parade-magic-show-bake-sale/
LOCATION:Kimbourne Park United Church\, 200 Wolverleigh blvd\, Toronto\, M4C 1S2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/21132707/Halloween-Costume-Parade-Magic-Show.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Kimbourne Park United Church":MAILTO:office@kpuc.org
END:VEVENT
