SUMMARY:Fall Youth Arts Market
DESCRIPTION:The Youth Arts Lab is hosting a Youth Fall Arts Market for youth artists between the ages of 8 and 17 to showcase and sell their work! This event is supported by East End Arts as part of their ArtLabs program. \nTaking place at St. Matthew’s Clubhouse on October 25th 2026 from 12:00pm-4:00pm\, please come by to support nearly 20 talented youth vendors who will be selling a variety of handmade art pieces and products for their very first time 👏! \n✨ You can learn more about the vendors on their Instagram page here: https://instagram.com/youthartslab
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/fall-youth-arts-market/
LOCATION:St. Matthew’s Clubhouse\, 450 Broadview Avenue\, Toronto\, M4K 2N3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19180440/Youth-Fall-Arts-Market-Poster.png
ORGANIZER;CN="East End Arts":MAILTO:info@eastendarts.ca
END:VEVENT
