SUMMARY:Degrassi: School's Out Screening and Q&A w/ Pat Mastroianni and Stacie Mistysyn
DESCRIPTION:Join us Sunday October 25th 2026 at 5:30pm for a special screening of ‘Degrassi: School’s Out’ (the final Degrassi High movie) followed by a Q&A with stars Pat Mastroianni (Joey Jeremiah) and Stacie Mistysyn (Caitlin Ryan) from the original Degrassi High! \nEach ticket includes entry to the movie\, attendance to the Q&A with Pat and Stacie\, as well as 1 free regular popcorn and drink to make your back to school Degrassi movie experience the best it can be! \nSunday October 25th 2026 – Beach United Church – 140 Wineva Ave\, Toronto\, ON M4E 2T4 (North of Queen East on Wineva) \nDoors open at 5:30pm. Movie Starts 6:00pm with Q&A to follow. \nAll are welcome. Limited general seating. \nAdvanced tickets only (no at-door tickets will be offered) \nGet your tickets today! \nBrought to you by Oak Artist Management \nwww.oakartistmgmt.com
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/degrassi-schools-out-screening-and-qa-w-pat-mastroianni-and-stacie-mistysyn/
LOCATION:Beach United Church\, 140 Wineva Ave.\, Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17104833/Schools-out-for-Beach-Metro-Newsletter.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Oak Artist Management":MAILTO:info@oakartistmgmt.com
END:VEVENT
