SUMMARY:Mission Yellow fundraiser for United Way Greater Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Calling East Toronto residents and businesses! \nHelp break a world record by wearing a whole lotta yellow! \nThe Globe and Mail and First Gulf invite you to join us as we transform 351 King St. E into a sea of yellow and attempt to set a new world record while raising money for the United Way Greater Toronto. \nCost: $5 per participant (all proceeds will be donated directly to United Way Greater Toronto) \nWhen: Oct. 29 11 am – noon\nWhere: The Globe and Mail Centre\, Ground Floor Lobby \nRegister here \n 
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/mission-yellow-fundraiser-for-united-way-greater-toronto/
