SUMMARY:The Dark Knightmare Before Christmas
DESCRIPTION:A hilarious comedy show mashing up Batman and The Nightmare Before Christmas\, with a live band playing hit songs throughout! Players (a local not-for-profit) has been producing sold-out shows for 22 years and has donated over ¼ of a million to charity over that time. This year we’re supporting the food bank amongst other charities\, so come laugh for a great cause! Shows are Thurs Oct 29th & Fri Oct 30th @ 7pm.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/the-dark-knightmare-before-christmas/
LOCATION:Comedy Bar Danforth\, 2800 Danforth\, Toronto\, M4C1M1
