SUMMARY:Benefit Concert for bassist Ron Johnston
DESCRIPTION:Ron Johnston\, a beloved member of the Toronto jazz community\, had emergency surgery in September and faces several months of rehabilitation. Ron’s music friends\nare staging a Pay What You Can benefit concert for him. Performers will include Bob Brough\, George Koller\, Tony Quarrington\, Julie Michels and Jaymz Bee. For more information\, contact Jack Ridout at jackseventlists@gmail.com
