SUMMARY:Spooky Sweater Swap
DESCRIPTION:Come out and enjoy a (Spooky) Sustainable\, Second-hand Sweater Swap!\nCreep it real this Halloween by helping your closet and the planet! Join artist Chelsea Virginia at St. Matthew’s Clubhouse (home of East End Arts) to get rid of sweaters that are no longer serving you and find new-to-you sweaters for the colder seasons ahead.\nAll kinds of adult sweaters\, hoodies\, and light jackets are welcome (this is not an exclusive “Halloween” sweater swap\, but just a sweater swap that is taking place on Halloween). Max of 10 quality (clean and washed) items per person. FREE to attend. View the full swap rules and information on the Eventbrite page here: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/spooky-sweater-swap-tickets-2002987210666
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/spooky-sweater-swap/
LOCATION:St. Matthew’s Clubhouse\, 450 Broadview Avenue\, Toronto\, M4K 2N3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19181506/spooky-sweater-swap-1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Chelsea Virginia":MAILTO:chelsvcreates@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
